00:58:27.050 --> 00:58:35.090
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program, Mr. Torey Malatia, who does not understand why we did Act Four today, no matter what I say.
<v Ira Glass>我们节目的WBEZ管理监督是托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）先生，无论我怎么说，他都不明白我们为什么今天要播第四幕。

00:58:35.090 --> 00:58:43.070
<v Simon>So basically, you're saying it's an inexplicable act, and it happened for no real reason at all?
<v Simon>所以基本上，你是在说这是一种无法解释的行为，而且它发生时根本没有任何真正的理由？

00:58:43.070 --> 00:58:55.140
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of this American life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多这些美国生活的故事。

